msgctxt "92"
msgid "Excuse me... aren't you Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"It's me, Kitagawa! The Mars Fighter, remember? You helped set me straight "
"back in Sotenbori, about two years back?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Kitagawa? Mars Fighter...? Oh, right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"You really saved my bacon! I killed it at the Grand Prix, and I finally hit "
"it big in Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Glad to hear it. You back in Kamurocho on personal business?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Huh? No, I'm on the clock, buddy! We're shootin' a drama right nearby."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "What, do I look like I'm on vacation, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"Well, I thought you always worked with a partner. But I don't see him "
"around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Oh, you mean Minamizawa... Yeah, things aren't exactly goin' smooth there..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Something happen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"Well... everything was great when we debuted as the Mars Fighters, about a "
"year back. But six months after, Minamizawa up and vanished..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "He didn't leave you any kind of clue about where he was going?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Not a one. Honestly, doing variety show gigs in Tokyo isn't exactly a "
"glamorous life, so maybe he decided enough was enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"Me, I'll take whatever work pays the bills, but you know how Minamizawa was "
"set on stickin' to manzai comedy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "I remember, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"Since he left, I've been getting by on talk show appearances and TV dramas, "
"but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"I'm worried about the guy. Whenever I get a break between gigs, I pick up "
"the search for him again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"Just yesterday, I heard someone spotted him in Kamurocho, so here I am. "
"But, well... no sign of him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"I want to do manzai comedy with him again! But until I can, I gotta keep "
"working, so our audience never forgets the Mars Fighters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"Look, Kiryu-san, if you spot Minamizawa around town, you wanna give me a "
"call? Take my number and one of his recent pics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "You got <Color:8>Minamizawa's Photo<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "All right. I'll call you if I find Minamizawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Thanks... Thank you so much!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "Kitagawa-san! It's almost time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "Ah, geez, already?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"Okay, I got a shoot comin' up, so I gotta run. Sorry to drag you into this, "
"but please, keep an eye out for him!"
msgstr ""

